{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/315553/", "pk": 315553, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/", "pk": 12514, "shortname": "sanfranciscotoursandactivities", "name": "San Francisco Tours and Activities", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Alcatraz Tour Package", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 0, "unicode": "Alcatraz Tour Package", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": -16.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": -16.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 4687, "description": "#Alcatraz is a must see in San Fransisco! \n\n**Alcatraz + Bike Rental Package Includes:**\n\n- A visit INSIDE the Alcatraz prison cells\n- Ferry ride and admission to Alcatraz Island from Pier 33\n- A 45-minute award wining audio tour in multiple languages on the island\n- Up to 2 days use of a bicycle for a self-guided bike tour (includes helmet, lock, biking map, and use of bicycle)\n- Option to upgrade to electric bikes with a fee (+$50 per person) \n\n\n**Alcatraz + Bus Tour Package Includes:**\n\n- A visit INSIDE the Alcatraz prison cells\n- Alcatraz ferry and entrance (includes a 45-minute award wining audio tour in multiple languages on the island)\n- A 1-day unlimited use hop-on hop-off bus ticket that includes visits to the Golden Gate Bridge, Fisherman's  Wharf, Union Square, Golden Gate Park, Alamo Square, Chinatown, and more!\n- Option to upgrade to a 2-day tour with a fee (+$20 per person)\n\n\n**Alcatraz + Bay Cruise Package Includes:**\n\n- A visit INSIDE the Alcatraz prison cells\n- Alcatraz ferry and entrance (includes a 45-minute award wining audio tour in multiple languages on the island)\n- A 60-minute San Francisco Bay Cruise tour to see around the Alcatraz Island and under the Golden Gate Bridge! Multiple daily departure schedule, Bay Cruise tickets are valid for any day.\n\n\n#Duration\n\n- Alcatraz Tour: Approximately 2.5 - 3 hours, departs from Pier 33\n- Hop-on Hop-off Bus Tour: Valid for 1-day or 2-day unlimited use\n- Bay Cruise Tour: 60-minutes, multiple departures daily from Pier 39\n\n\n#How It Works\n\n- You will receive your tour tickets by email after the booking is complete.\n- Alcatraz Location: Pier 33 (Alcatraz Landing)\n- Departure Time: TBD\n- Bus tour starting point: 99 Jefferson st. Hours: 10am to 5pm daily. Frequency: every 15-30mins between buses.\n- Bike rental location: 1465 Lombard street, San Francisco. Hours: 9am to 5pm daily.\n\n\n\n#Available Times\n**Please select available date/time during check out**\nThis Alcatraz cruise ticket includes the ferry to the Alcatraz Island, the 45-minutes audio tour, and the entrance to the Alcatraz Island cell blocks. It also includes a Hop on Hop off open top bus tour OR a bike rental for the ultimate San Francisco experience. The Alcatraz tour ticket is very popular and it is recommended that you book in advance online to secure your Alcatraz tour spot. \n\nYou can stay on Alcatraz Island as long as you like, but allow at least 3 hours for cruising to the Island, taking the Cellhouse audio tour, exploring the rest of the Island and its historic exhibits and returning via ferry to Pier 33 Alcatraz Landing.\n\nThe Alcatraz tour ticket package contains tour activities that are operated by different tour agencies. You will receive ticketing instructions by email once your booking is confirmed.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Pier 33, Fisherman’s Wharf", "booking_notes": "You will receive all tour tickets and instructions in a separate email shortly.\n\nAlcatraz Tour Address: Pier 33, San Francisco", "cancellation_notes": "All sales are final. No refund, exchange, or cancellation on Alcatraz packages.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Book now before it's completely sold out!", "short_description": "Combined Alcatraz admission with choice of bike rental, hop-on hop-off bus, or bay cruise for a flexible San Francisco experience.", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/315553/images/706312/", "pk": 706312, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/H7WvZjGQBqEjbeR52yGh", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/H7WvZjGQBqEjbeR52yGh", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/315553/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/H7WvZjGQBqEjbeR52yGh", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/H7WvZjGQBqEjbeR52yGh", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/items/315553/images/706313/", "pk": 706313, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qAEet9tQQfOQFzNGumpw", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/qAEet9tQQfOQFzNGumpw", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sanfranciscotoursandactivities/"}, "item": {"cls": "It